{"unit_id": "tag:01QX:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>为闭浸入（closed immersion）。由上面的引理，我们常略用记号，以<MATH_0002>表示层（sheaf）<MATH_0003>，该层定义在<MATH_0004>上。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "此处指闭浸入态射。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "此处指所记的层。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01QZ:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>为准凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0003>-模（module）。设<MATH_0004>为<MATH_0005>-子模（submodule）。存在唯一的准凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0006>-子模（submodule）<MATH_0007>，具有如下性质：对每个准凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0008>-模（module）<MATH_0009>，映射（map）<MATH_0010>是双射（bijective）。特别地，<MATH_0011>是准凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0012>-子模（submodule），且在<MATH_0013>中包含于<MATH_0014>的所有此类对象中最大。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "准凝聚"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "submodule", "target_term": "子模"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "准凝聚"}, {"source_term": "submodule", "target_term": "子模"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "准凝聚"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "bijective", "target_term": "双射"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "准凝聚"}, {"source_term": "submodule", "target_term": "子模"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引理所给的概形。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "准凝聚", "context": "所给模的性质。"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "所给的准凝聚模。"}, {"source_term": "submodule", "target_term": "子模", "context": "所给的子模。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "准凝聚", "context": "存在性结论中子模的性质。"}, {"source_term": "submodule", "target_term": "子模", "context": "唯一存在的子模。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "准凝聚", "context": "全称量化的模的性质。"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "全称量化的模。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "泛性质中的映射。"}, {"source_term": "bijective", "target_term": "双射", "context": "泛性质要求映射为双射。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "准凝聚", "context": "最大性结论中子模的性质。"}, {"source_term": "submodule", "target_term": "子模", "context":