{"unit_id": "tag:01QZ:proof", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>，并设<MATH_0002>为如下集合（set）：其中的元素为准凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0003>-子模（submodules），且包含于<MATH_0004>中。于是，像（image）<MATH_0005>（取自<MATH_0006>）是准凝聚（quasi-coherent）的，因为在<MATH_0007>上，准凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaves）之间的映射（map）的像（image）是准凝聚（quasi-coherent）的，且准凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaves）的直和（direct sum）是准凝聚（quasi-coherent）的，见概形（Schemes）一章第<REF_0001>节。模（module）<MATH_0008>包含于<MATH_0009>中。因此，它是最大的准凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0010>-模（module），这里的最大性是就包含于<MATH_0011>的此类对象而言。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n为证明该公式，设<MATH_0012>为准凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0013>-模（module），并设<MATH_0014>为<MATH_0015>-模映射（module map）。复合（composition）<MATH_0016>的像（image）是准凝聚（quasi-coherent）的，因为它是准凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaves）之间的映射（map）的像（image）。因此，它包含于<MATH_0017>中。所以<MATH_0018>经<MATH_0019>分解（factors through），这正是所需的结论。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "准凝聚"}, {"source_term": "submodules", "target_term": "子模"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "准凝聚"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "准凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "准凝聚"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "准凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "direct sum", "target_term": "直和"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "准凝聚"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "准凝聚"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "准凝聚"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "module map", "target_term": "模映射"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "quasi-cohe