{"unit_id": "tag:01R0:proof", "translation": "给定准凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0001>-模（module）<MATH_0002>，考虑子层（subsheaf）<MATH_0003>，它由<MATH_0004>中被<MATH_0005>零化（annihilated）的局部截面（local sections）构成。由引理<REF_0001>，存在典范的（canonical）最大准凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0006>-子模（submodule）<MATH_0007>。按构造有<MATH_0008>，对任意准凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0009>-模（module）<MATH_0010>均成立。因此可以令<MATH_0011>。细节从略。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "准凝聚"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "subsheaf", "target_term": "子层"}, {"source_term": "annihilated", "target_term": "零化"}, {"source_term": "local sections", "target_term": "局部截面"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范的"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "准凝聚"}, {"source_term": "submodule", "target_term": "子模"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "准凝聚"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "准凝聚", "context": "所给模的性质。"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "证明开始时所给的模。"}, {"source_term": "subsheaf", "target_term": "子层", "context": "由指定截面构成的子层。"}, {"source_term": "annihilated", "target_term": "零化", "context": "局部截面所满足的零化条件。"}, {"source_term": "local sections", "target_term": "局部截面", "context": "构成子层的截面。"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范的", "context": "最大子模的典范性。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "准凝聚", "context": "最大子模的性质。"}, {"source_term": "submodule", "target_term": "子模", "context": "由引理得到的最大子模。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "准凝聚", "context": "任取的模的性质。"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "等式对其成立的任意模。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01QX:prose-0003", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n利用<MATH_0001>对<MATH_0002>的对应，即理想（ideals）的准凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaves）与闭子概形（closed subschemes）之间的对应（见引理<REF_0001>），可以定义概形（scheme）意义下的交（intersections）与并（unions），对象为闭子概形（closed subschemes）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "ideals", "target_term": "理想"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "准凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "closed subschemes", "target_term": "闭子概形"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "intersections", "target_term": "交"}, {"source_term": "unions", "target_term": "并"}, {"source_term": "closed subschemes", "target_term": "闭子概形"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "ideals", "target_term": "理想", "context": "构成相应准凝聚层的理想。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "准凝聚层", "context": "对应一侧的层。"}, {"source_term": "closed subschemes", "target_term": "闭子概形", "context": "对应另一侧的概形。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "限定交与并在概形意义下取。"}, {"source_term": "intersections", "target_term": "交", "context": "在概形意义下定义的交。"}, {"source_term": "unions", "target_term": "并", "context": "在概形意义下定义的并。"}, {"source_term": "closed subschemes", "target_term": "闭子概形", "context": "进行交与并运算的对象。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0C4H:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>为与准凝聚（quasi-coherent）理想（ideal）层（sheaves）<MATH_0003>对应的闭子概形（closed subschemes）。\n<TEXTITOPEN_0001>概形论交（scheme theoretic intersection）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，对<MATH_0004>和<MATH_0005>而言，是<MATH_0006>中由<MATH_0007>定义的闭子概形（closed subscheme）。\n<TEXTITOPEN_0002>概形论并（scheme theoretic union）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，对<MATH_0008>和<MATH_0009>而言，是<MATH_0010>中由<MATH_0011>定义的闭子概形（closed subscheme）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "准凝聚"}, {"source_term": "ideal", "target_term": "理想"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "closed subschemes", "target_term": "闭子概形"}, {"source_term": "scheme theoretic intersection", "target_term": "概形论交"}, {"source_term": "closed subscheme", "target_term": "闭子概形"}, {"source_term": "scheme theoretic union", "target_term": "概形论并"}, {"source_term": "closed subscheme", "target_term": "闭子概形"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "定义中的环境概形。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "准凝聚", "context": "理想层的性质。"}, {"source_term": "ideal", "target_term": "理想", "context": "所给层为理想层。"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "与闭子概形对应的层。"}, {"source_term": "closed subschemes", "target_term": "闭子概形", "context": "进行交与并运算的对象。"}, {"source_term": "scheme theoretic intersection", "target_term": "概形论交", "context": "定义的交运算。"}, {"source_term": "closed subscheme", "target_term": "闭子概形", "context": "交运算的结果。"}, {"source_term": "scheme theoretic union", "target_term": "概形论并", "context": "定义的并运算。"}, {"source_term": "closed subscheme", "target_term": "闭子概形", "context": "并运算的结果。"}], "notes": []}
