{"unit_id": "tag:0C4I:proof", "translation": "态射（morphisms）<MATH_0001>和<MATH_0002>由引理<REF_0001>知是闭浸入（closed immersions）。\n设<MATH_0003>是仿射开集（affine open），位于<MATH_0004>中，并设<MATH_0005>和<MATH_0006>分别对应于理想（ideals）<MATH_0007>和<MATH_0008>。于是<MATH_0009>对应于<MATH_0010>。由于<MATH_0011>，根据概形（Schemes）一章第<REF_0002>节中对概形（schemes）的纤维积（fibre products）的描述，可知该图表（diagram）是笛卡儿的（cartesian）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "closed immersions", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "ideals", "target_term": "理想"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "fibre products", "target_term": "纤维积"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表"}, {"source_term": "cartesian", "target_term": "笛卡儿的"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "由引理判定为闭浸入的态射。"}, {"source_term": "closed immersions", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "所给态射的性质。"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "用来局部考察的开集。"}, {"source_term": "ideals", "target_term": "理想", "context": "与所给闭子概形对应的理想。"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引用的章名。"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "取纤维积的对象。"}, {"source_term": "fibre products", "target_term": "纤维积", "context": "引用章节所描述的构造。"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表", "context": "有待判定性质的图表。"}, {"source_term": "cartesian", "target_term": "笛卡儿的", "context": "借助纤维积判定的图表性质。"}], "notes": []}
