{"unit_id": "tag:05AC:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>为准凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf），定义在<MATH_0003>上。<MATH_0004>的支集（support）在特化下封闭（closed under specialization）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "准凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "support", "target_term": "支集"}, {"source_term": "closed under specialization", "target_term": "在特化下封闭"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引理给定的概形。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "准凝聚层", "context": "引理所考察的层。"}, {"source_term": "support", "target_term": "支集", "context": "待证具有封闭性质的支集。"}, {"source_term": "closed under specialization", "target_term": "在特化下封闭", "context": "支集在取特化时保持封闭。"}], "notes": []}
