{"unit_id": "tag:056H:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n对有限型（finite type）准（quasi）凝聚模（coherent modules），其支集（support）是闭的（closed），可在纤维（fibres）上检验，且与基变换（base change）可交换（commutes）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "quasi", "target_term": "准"}, {"source_term": "coherent modules", "target_term": "凝聚模"}, {"source_term": "support", "target_term": "支集"}, {"source_term": "closed", "target_term": "闭的"}, {"source_term": "fibres", "target_term": "纤维"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "可交换"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "限定本段所考察的准凝聚模。"}, {"source_term": "quasi", "target_term": "准", "context": "与后面的凝聚模合成准凝聚模。"}, {"source_term": "coherent modules", "target_term": "凝聚模", "context": "与前缀合用，指本段所考察的准凝聚模。"}, {"source_term": "support", "target_term": "支集", "context": "本段讨论的构造。"}, {"source_term": "closed", "target_term": "闭的", "context": "取支集所得到的集合的拓扑性质。"}, {"source_term": "fibres", "target_term": "纤维", "context": "可用于检验支集。"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换", "context": "与取支集可交换的运算。"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "可交换", "context": "说明取支集和基变换的关系。"}], "notes": []}
